Only reftests are vendored: a test page and the page it names with
`<link rel=match>`, which must render identically. That is the part of WPT an
engine with no JavaScript can run.

manifest.json lists what was taken and counts what was not, by reason. The
largest exclusions are tests needing JavaScript and tests whose reference lives
outside the directory (following those would drag in the support trees).

Refresh with tools/fetch_wpt.py, which rewrites both the files and the
manifest, in the same change.
